WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.667
-Republicans,
including Donald Trump,

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:05.634
gathered for a truly unhinged
conservative conference

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:06.868
over the weekend
where Trump claimed,

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:08.400
among other things,

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.801
that he was the most persecuted
individual in American history

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.467
after last week's bombshell
hearing

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.434
of the January 6th committee
embarrassed him by airing

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:18.934
never before seen
outtakes of his speech

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.334
from the day
after the insurrection.

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:23.100
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.868
If, if you want a sense

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:32.667
of what the modern conservative
movement is truly like,

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.267
there's probably no better
example than this clip

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:37.834
from over the weekend
of Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:39.567
walking on stage to,

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:42.267
let's say, some slightly
overzealous fanfare

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:45.968
involving lights, dramatic
music, and smoke machines.

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:53.801
♪♪

00:00:53.801 --> 00:01:01.667
♪♪

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:09.501
♪♪

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:13.200
-Wow!
-Yeah.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.000
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.634
Yeah. Wow.

00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:22.100
Talk about blowing smoke
up someone's ass.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:27.467
There's never been a bigger gap
between the drama of an entrance

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:31.534
and the charisma of the person
making the entrance.

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:35.133
That was like if the lights
if the lights went down

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.234
and you heard
Michael Buffer say,

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.701
"Let's get ready to rumble!"

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:42.534
And then the lights came up on
like a spelling bee.

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:43.901
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:46.367
Not a good one. Not scripts.

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:50.934
I think after an entrance
like that,

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:52.434
you expect to see The Rock,

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:55.968
not someone
with the personality of a rock.

00:01:55.968 --> 00:01:58.634
Can you smell what Ted Cruz
is cooking?

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:02.801
It's an expired Lean Cuisine.

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:04.234
I found it
in the back of the freezer,

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:07.667
just covered in ice, but I think
it's probably still good, right?

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:10.467
It would have been great if they
gave him the same introduction,

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:13.200
but instead he had to enter
with his rolling suitcase

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.467
