[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:19.334
Also, why is this guy
having so much fun?

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:21.534
In the last two years,
he's been caught leaving Texas

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:23.968
