00:02:38.868 --> 00:02:40.400
If even one of those things
happened to me,

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.934
I'd never show my face
in public again.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:44.067
But this bozo gets to whoop
it up shamelessly

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.334
with the pyrotechnics

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:47.200
from an eighth graders
roller skate party.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.701
It's not fair!

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:52.901
And unfortunately, that entrance
was just the beginning.

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:54.067
This is what
the Republican Party

00:02:54.067 --> 00:02:57.200
