no substance.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.067
They're all just professional
wrestlers and insult comics now,

00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:02.734
which I guess is what Cruz
is going for in his speech

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:05.734
