00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:23.400
Well, I'm Ted Cruz,
and my pronoun is kiss my ass.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.467
-Ted Cruz is less a person

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:30.968
and more a bumper sticker
with a beard.

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:33.234
Of course, the real victim
in that story isn't Ted Cruz.

00:03:33.234 --> 00:03:35.868
It's the student
at the supposed woke university

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:38.300
