since it makes no sense.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.234
They just roared at Cruz
saying the word ass.

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:08.701
The same thing happens
at Trump rallies all the time.

00:04:08.701 --> 00:04:10.400
The dude just rambles
